{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ss-go-lore-collection",
    "name": "SS-GO.lore",
    "description": "Lore & World Building CRUD endpoints for SS-GO API.\n\n**All endpoints require studio member authentication (JWT).**\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- `api_url` — base URL (e.g., `http://localhost:8080`)\n- `access_token` — from Auth module login\n- `game_id` — from Games module create\n\n**Lore types:** `world`, `region`, `faction`, `character`, `item_lore`, `event`, `custom`\n\n**Run order:**\n1. Create Lore Entry (saves `lore_entry_id`)\n2. List Lore Entries\n3. Get Lore Entry\n4. Update Lore Entry\n5. Delete Lore Entry",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create Lore Entry",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get(\"access_token\");",
              "if (!token) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: No access token found. Please login first.\");",
              "}",
              "var gameId = pm.environment.get(\"game_id\");",
              "if (!gameId) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: game_id not found. Create a game first.\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is less than 500ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response is JSON\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has lore entry structure\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.ID).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.Title).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.LoreType).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.CreatedAt).to.be.a('string');",
              "});",
              "",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "if (jsonData.ID) {",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"lore_entry_id\", jsonData.ID);",
              "    console.log(\"✓ Lore entry ID saved:\", jsonData.ID);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"lore_type\": \"character\",\n    \"title\": \"Arveth the Wanderer\",\n    \"summary\": \"A wandering knight who guards the ancient ruins of the east.\",\n    \"content\": \"Arveth spent decades roaming the crumbled fortresses of the Eastern Reach, cataloguing every relic he found. His journal became the definitive guide for adventurers.\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/games/{{game_id}}/lore",
          "host": ["{{api_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "games", "{{game_id}}", "lore"]
        },
        "description": "Create a new lore entry for a game.\n\nAuthentication: Required (Studio member JWT)\n\n**lore_type values:** `world`, `region`, `faction`, `character`, `item_lore`, `event`, `custom`\n\n**Limits:** title ≤ 255 chars, summary ≤ 500 chars, content ≤ 100 000 chars, max 1 000 entries per game."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "List Lore Entries",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get(\"access_token\");",
              "if (!token) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: No access token found. Please login first.\");",
              "}",
              "var gameId = pm.environment.get(\"game_id\");",
              "if (!gameId) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: game_id not found. Create a game first.\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is less than 500ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response is JSON\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has pagination structure\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.total).to.be.a('number');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.limit).to.be.a('number');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.offset).to.be.a('number');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/games/{{game_id}}/lore?limit=20&offset=0",
          "host": ["{{api_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "games", "{{game_id}}", "lore"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Max items to return (1-100, default 20)" },
            { "key": "offset", "value": "0", "description": "Number of items to skip" },
            { "key": "type", "value": "character", "description": "Filter by lore_type (world|region|faction|character|item_lore|event|custom)", "disabled": true }
          ]
        },
        "description": "List lore entries for a game with optional type filter and pagination.\n\nAuthentication: Required (Studio member JWT)\n\n**Query params:**\n- `limit` — 1–100, default 20\n- `offset` — default 0\n- `type` — optional filter by lore type"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Lore Entry",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get(\"access_token\");",
              "if (!token) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: No access token found. Please login first.\");",
              "}",
              "var entryId = pm.environment.get(\"lore_entry_id\");",
              "if (!entryId) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: lore_entry_id not found. Run 'Create Lore Entry' first.\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is less than 500ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response is JSON\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has expected structure\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.ID).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.Title).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.LoreType).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.CreatedAt).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/games/{{game_id}}/lore/{{lore_entry_id}}",
          "host": ["{{api_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "games", "{{game_id}}", "lore", "{{lore_entry_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Get a single lore entry by ID.\n\nAuthentication: Required (Studio member JWT)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Lore Entry",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get(\"access_token\");",
              "if (!token) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: No access token found. Please login first.\");",
              "}",
              "var entryId = pm.environment.get(\"lore_entry_id\");",
              "if (!entryId) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: lore_entry_id not found. Run 'Create Lore Entry' first.\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is less than 500ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response is JSON\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has expected structure\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.ID).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.UpdatedAt).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Arveth the Wanderer (Updated)\",\n    \"summary\": \"A legendary knight and chronicler of the Eastern Reach.\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/games/{{game_id}}/lore/{{lore_entry_id}}",
          "host": ["{{api_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "games", "{{game_id}}", "lore", "{{lore_entry_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Partially update a lore entry. All fields are optional — omitted fields are left unchanged.\n\nAuthentication: Required (Studio member JWT)\n\n**Updatable fields:** `title`, `summary`, `content`"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Delete Lore Entry",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "var token = pm.environment.get(\"access_token\");",
              "if (!token) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: No access token found. Please login first.\");",
              "}",
              "var entryId = pm.environment.get(\"lore_entry_id\");",
              "if (!entryId) {",
              "    console.log(\"⚠ Warning: lore_entry_id not found. Run 'Create Lore Entry' first.\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 204\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is less than 500ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
              "    pm.environment.unset(\"lore_entry_id\");",
              "    console.log(\"✓ lore_entry_id cleared\");",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/api/v1/games/{{game_id}}/lore/{{lore_entry_id}}",
          "host": ["{{api_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "games", "{{game_id}}", "lore", "{{lore_entry_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Soft-delete a lore entry. Returns 204 No Content on success.\n\nAuthentication: Required (Studio member JWT)"
      }
    }
  ]
}
